# UI Component Rules

- All visual components should be written in React with JSX.
- Use Tailwind CSS utility classes and daisyUI elements.
- **NEVER use inline styles** (`style="..."` or `style={{...}}`).
- **NEVER manipulate `.style` properties** in JavaScript/TypeScript.
- **NEVER use `cssText`** for dynamic styling.
- Use CSS classes and Tailwind utilities for all styling needs.
- Any third-party UI should be abstracted behind reusable internal components.
- For dynamic styling, use conditional class names or CSS custom properties.
- Prefer DaisyUI component classes (`btn`, `input`, `card`, etc.) over custom styling.
